Sample(
    sample_id=...,
    text=...,
    label=...,
    label_status=...,
    split=...,
    dataset_id=...,
    dataset_version=...,
    poison_ground_truth=None,
)
```

Do not create:

```text
JSONLSample
CSVSample
```

There must remain one canonical sample representation.

---

